    "status": "draft",
    "summary": "Spec 196 pinned `serde-saphyr` at `=1.3.0` and declined 2.0.0 because it had been published the day before. Dependabot #504 proposes 2.0.0 (with `granit-parser` 2.0.0 and `sha2` 0.11.1) and fails to compile: 2.0 deprecates the option 196's reader sets to refuse a non-finite float. This spec takes 2.0.0, sets the option's replacement to the same refusal, and moves the three `cargo vet` exemptions to the new versions. Every parity row 196 pinned holds unchanged.\n",
